  "historyNote": "#5072, eff 2-21-91, EXPIRED 2-21-97 New. #6476, eff 3-26-97; ss by #6869, eff 10-20-98; ss by #8306, eff 3-22-05; ss by #10304, eff 3-22-13; ss by #13503, eff 12-9-22",
